  "verdict": "revise",
  "issues": [
    "GROUNDING: The within‑segment differences reported in the evidence (e.g., loyal +0.039618) are not supported by the printed conversion rates (email loyal 0.581560, paid_search loyal 0.758621), which would give a negative difference. The numbers used to compute the weighted average do not appear in the output.",
    "OVERREACH: The answer presents the adjusted difference as a “valid comparison of the campaign effect,” implying a causal effect despite the channel being non‑randomised and only adjusted for one confounder.",
    "UNACKNOWLEDGED DATA PROBLEMS: The analysis mentions correcting 21 invalid conversions but never shows that correction; the conversion rates printed still include those invalid rows, so the final estimate may be biased."
